# Public API (pe:*)
  @api pe:open(body, commit, poly)  @ 234-293
      @contract  mint a checkout take on scratch, materialise `body`, bind the mini tm; `commit(newBody)` is the write-back  @ 231
      @contract  snapshots the body and arms write-through once materialised (open/close rebuilds stay silent)  @ 232
      @contract  an empty body (no lengthPpq) defaults its loop to one bar of the checkout take  @ 233
  @api pe:close()  @ 297-306
      @contract  sweep the pool metadata (write-through, so leaks without this)  @ 295
      @contract  unbind the mini tm, delete the checkout item  @ 296
  @api pe:isOpen()  @ 308
  @api pe:currentTake()  @ 309
  @api pe:draw()  @ 418-459
      @contract  draw pass -- toolbar row, grid fills the region below; popup sizes to fit  @ 417
  @api pe:handleInput(close)  @ 463-489
      @contract  input pass -- mouse, dispatch against mini cmgr, note entry; unconsumed Esc cancels, Enter commits  @ 461
      @contract  returns the dispatch result kr = { consumed, commandHeld }  @ 462
  @api pe:launch(body, commit, poly)  @ 497-523
      @contract  production entry -- mint the checkout on `body` and raise the editing modal; onClose sweeps it  @ 496

